r which Council will exercise a concurrence agency role ...'; Table 1.6.1 identifies 9.3.1 'RADs and performance outcomes identified by notes as a planning scheme matter' as the alternative provisions to QDC boundary clearance and site cover provisions (Building Act s33)."}$q$::jsonb);
